<title>UK: Goldman ups Deutsche Bank to outperformer.</title>
<headline>Goldman ups Deutsche Bank to outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs on Tuesday said it raised its rating on Deutsche Bank AG to &quot;market outperformer&quot; from &quot;market performer&quot;.</p>
<p>Analysts at the U.S. investment bank were not available for further comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
